OL,3,GNEWSANo plans for age of consent review
OL,4,Ain Jersey
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's government has no plans to
OL,7,Freview the age of consent despite calls
OL,8,Fin the UK for stronger protections for
OL,9,Fteenagers.
OL,11,FCampaigners have called for a staggered
OL,12,Fage of consent in the UK where adults
OL,13,Fover a certain age are prohibited from
OL,14,Fhaving sexual relationships with 16 and
OL,15,F17-year-olds.
OL,17,FMinister for Justice and Home Affairs
OL,18,FMary Le Hegarat said any changes would
OL,19,Frequire "careful consideration" but
OL,20,Fwere not part of current work to tackle
OL,21,Fviolence against women and girls
OL,22,F(VAWG).
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
